    "directions": [
      "In a sauce pot, add oil. Once it gets hot, add onions and saute well.",
      "Once it turns light brown in color, add salt to taste saute well.",
      "Add tomatoes and cook on medium flame. Once it's cooked well, keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a large bowl, add curd, ginger garlic paste, bay leaf, cloves, green cardamom, black cardamom.",
      "Add black peppercorns, mace, cinnamon stick, degi red chili powder, turmeric powder, a pinch of asafoetida.",
      "Add coriander powder, cumin powder, and prepared onion tomato mixture.",
      "Now, add chicken drumstick, salt to taste, almonds and marinate well. Rest it for 10-15 minutes.",
      "In a saucepot, add the marinated chicken mixture.",
      "Cover it with the lid and cook for 5-10 minutes on low flame.",
      "Now, heat up a piece of charcoal directly on the gas stove.",
      "Once the charcoal is hot enough, place it in the steel bowl along with cloves. Now, add rogan from chicken angara and place the steel bowl in chicken angara.",
      "Cover the lid and let it cook for 15-20 minutes.",
      "Once the chicken is cooked well, transfer it into a serving dish, garnish it with coriander sprig.",
      "Serve hot with roti or rice."
    ],
